# Keeps this directory present when it holds no plan.
#
# An empty wip/ says "this is the place, and there is nothing in it". A
# missing one says nothing, and reads as looking in the wrong place - and an
# IDE that drops the node on deletion makes you find and expand it again
# every time a plan appears.
#
# What belongs here, and when it is retired: see AGENTS.md, UAMF and Action
# Plan.
